{%- comment -%}
  Fyxx: Wine utility lines (product block content)
  The five reassurance lines for the wine buy experience. The wine template
  renders this snippet twice: once under the product image on desktop (inside
  the image column's sticky container, see snippets/section.main-product.liquid)
  and once after the buy column on mobile (the 'wine_utility' block, dispatched
  in sections/main-product.liquid). Each mount is wrapped in the theme's
  small--hide / medium-up--hide helpers, which hide with display:none, so only
  one copy is ever visible and a screen reader hears the lines once.

  The delivery and collect lines sit together at the top, the two fulfilment
  options. Both are static service copy, not stock: "Collect in Swefieh in an
  hour" describes the service and must never claim a specific bottle is ready,
  so there is no store link and nothing that implies live availability. The live
  pickup/availability component is NOT recreated here; its drawer uses fixed
  element ids, so a second instance would collide. No icons. No font-family is
  declared; the text inherits the body font. Only ink and alpha steps of ink
  are used.
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="fx-utility" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <ul class="fx-utility__list">
    <li>Delivery in under an hour</li>
    <li>Collect in Swefieh in an hour</li>
    <li>Free 7 day returns</li>
    <li>Earns Fyxx Points</li>
    <li>Secure online payment</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<style>
  .fx-utility {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(16, 15, 13, 0.15);
    margin-top: 22px;
    padding-top: 22px;
  }
  .fx-utility__list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .fx-utility__list li {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: rgba(16, 15, 13, 0.72);
  }
  .fx-utility__list li + li {
    margin-top: 11px;
  }
</style>
